## Summary

CarCare AI demonstrates an end-to-end AI application that combines computer vision, information retrieval, and local language-model generation.

The system identifies a visible vehicle component, retrieves relevant information from an automotive maintenance document, and generates document-grounded maintenance guidance through a local LLM.

```text
Vehicle Image
     ↓
YOLO11n-Seg
     ↓
Vehicle Part
     ↓
Hybrid RAG
     ↓
ChromaDB
     ↓
Llama 3.2
     ↓
Maintenance Guidance
```
